{"id":"ds:60:153:Dialogue Text","source":"[pic=3]Terrible recent mishap, absolutely terrible!","target":"[pic=3]Ein schreckliches Missgeschick neulich, wirklich schrecklich!","sourceSha256":"0785e186322cb2680e4c6dd34dce6ffb39299e068239277bc61956eab14e31a9","targetSha256":"218a432cbaa1b5b76d840c96d1bd6fbf96ab86a4e6cd8b8bd4d844928bce732a","conversationId":60,"conversation":"act1/bridgeQuest/01_introFromBeaver","actor":"3","conversant":"1","title":"","sequence":"","conditions":"","script":"","links":[{"originConversationID":60,"originDialogueID":153,"destinationConversationID":60,"destinationDialogueID":154,"isConnector":0,"priority":2}],"isGroup":0,"unchangedReason":null,"unchangedCategory":null}
{"id":"ds:60:155:Dialogue Text","source":"[pic=1]But it’s up to me to fix it and get this town in shape again!","target":"[pic=1]Aber es liegt an mir, sie zu reparieren und den Ort wieder auf Vordermann zu bringen!","sourceSha256":"db887236654b46fedd506e94a99791d01073555ecb265063419722dba2b9784d","targetSha256":"78942e5999cc0cb303b4e18329ab1116de0ff8c79ca04e9a7537d76af5bda0dd","conversationId":60,"conversation":"act1/bridgeQuest/01_introFromBeaver","actor":"3","conversant":"1","title":"","sequence":"","conditions":"","script":"","links":[{"originConversationID":60,"originDialogueID":155,"destinationConversationID":60,"destinationDialogueID":156,"isConnector":0,"priority":2}],"isGroup":0,"unchangedReason":null,"unchangedCategory":null}
{"id":"ds:209:134:Dialogue Text","source":"[pic=1]Bahaw! Got a ring to it dont’cha think? Thought of it myself!","target":"[pic=1]Bahaw! Das klingt doch gut, oder? Hab ich mir selbst ausgedacht!","sourceSha256":"f86a7335b4a7414c5a0131526a7763b52c9732154b6573dba347f4f7152ead6b","targetSha256":"c213964358a36f09f385e23310dfd126dc5d266233f7759a36dec64737a22b1e","conversationId":209,"conversation":"gossip/bird/pennyPlume","actor":"8","conversant":"1","title":"","sequence":"","conditions":"","script":"","links":[{"originConversationID":209,"originDialogueID":134,"destinationConversationID":209,"destinationDialogueID":135,"isConnector":0,"priority":2}],"isGroup":0,"unchangedReason":null,"unchangedCategory":null}
{"id":"ds:242:26:Dialogue Text","source":"[pic=1]If you find any trouble, be sure to invite me!","target":"[pic=1]Falls du welchen findest, lad mich unbedingt dazu ein!","sourceSha256":"860e37928acaf5b8bab0a743389d12ab4214337dbe66d5b82c13e37ae999f96f","targetSha256":"6b72b187a8971b2490e9c89bc25516b744722508a85b556066570b041d42897d","conversationId":242,"conversation":"idles/bunny","actor":"2","conversant":"1","title":"","sequence":"","conditions":"","script":"","links":[],"isGroup":0,"unchangedReason":null,"unchangedCategory":null}
{"id":"ds:303:411:Dialogue Text","source":"What is important to you?","target":"Was ist dir wirklich wichtig?","sourceSha256":"635346dbbc8d35268a00196326ac89299571c861217fd1402469c92c2da7a1bd","targetSha256":"0661ab1fb4d224462e53aa82cf94aa8e55db4d6b1072c476eb26c9a806845a51","conversationId":303,"conversation":"dates/oliverCoyotes/dialogue2","actor":"1","conversant":"15","title":"","sequence":"","conditions":"","script":"","links":[{"originConversationID":303,"originDialogueID":411,"destinationConversationID":303,"destinationDialogueID":413,"isConnector":0,"priority":2}],"isGroup":0,"unchangedReason":null,"unchangedCategory":null}
{"id":"ds:424:750:Dialogue Text","source":"[pic=1]Some of my finer work! And it was my first time working in ice too! Tricky stuff!","target":"[pic=1]Ein paar meiner besten Arbeiten! Und das erste Mal, dass ich mit Eis gearbeitet hab! Kniffliges Zeug!","sourceSha256":"4d035b2e4899098a751b6275741d2e9504684c5000ad16393fa8c30b3042a8a6","targetSha256":"a291ef57e76cb6d479a06f1eaee682046beb0c4120932dac39ac143ec38efffc","conversationId":424,"conversation":"act3/cookieQuest/03_CD_bucky","actor":"3","conversant":"1","title":"","sequence":"","conditions":"","script":"","links":[{"originConversationID":424,"originDialogueID":750,"destinationConversationID":424,"destinationDialogueID":751,"isConnector":0,"priority":2}],"isGroup":0,"unchangedReason":null,"unchangedCategory":null}
{"id":"ds:424:752:Dialogue Text","source":"It is!","target":"Tut es!","sourceSha256":"f852f837a3eae3378f6e5ba4600ce6440b9b56325bc38886f5ee8a7ae81bf1cc","targetSha256":"1711153d07ea00d7c6c4dc136cea7c9eda5346526b7d930b371cc2d7fe0093c0","conversationId":424,"conversation":"act3/cookieQuest/03_CD_bucky","actor":"1","conversant":"3","title":"","sequence":"","conditions":"","script":"","links":[{"originConversationID":424,"originDialogueID":752,"destinationConversationID":424,"destinationDialogueID":753,"isConnector":0,"priority":2}],"isGroup":0,"unchangedReason":null,"unchangedCategory":null}
{"id":"ds:458:246:Dialogue Text","source":"[pic=2]Thanks for choosing Penny Plume’s Ride and Zoom!","target":"[pic=2]Danke, dass du dich für Penny Feders Flug im Nu entschieden hast!","sourceSha256":"9722432f6630bf78d675ad69742f06f3365b5413fba5a6114ea913c81a49540e","targetSha256":"19a134e839dbe5517f5fc94046c8a7ca6e6d2b717fe6f14bf3d408c0a37b21e9","conversationId":458,"conversation":"act1/fastTravelDialogueTMP","actor":"8","conversant":"1","title":"","sequence":"","conditions":"","script":"","links":[{"originConversationID":458,"originDialogueID":246,"destinationConversationID":458,"destinationDialogueID":247,"isConnector":0,"priority":2}],"isGroup":0,"unchangedReason":null,"unchangedCategory":null}
{"id":"ds:458:337:Dialogue Text","source":"[pic=1]Finally, by riding Penny Plume’s Ride and Zoom you accept any and all accidental damages that can happen and may result in permanent damage, and or death!","target":"[pic=1]Und schließlich: Mit der Nutzung von Penny Feders Flug im Nu akzeptierst du sämtliche möglichen Unfallschäden, die zu bleibenden Schäden und/oder zum Tod führen können!","sourceSha256":"82539c4236b68bd1f31a0f9e5006851a397cf5129d71eb921b7509a3df99560e","targetSha256":"3eaccbe93876f71ba065393d8b57ff6b59d5f5137156f6220240741b8dbc3414","conversationId":458,"conversation":"act1/fastTravelDialogueTMP","actor":"8","conversant":"1","title":"","sequence":"","conditions":"","script":"","links":[{"originConversationID":458,"originDialogueID":337,"destinationConversationID":458,"destinationDialogueID":338,"isConnector":0,"priority":2}],"isGroup":0,"unchangedReason":null,"unchangedCategory":null}
{"id":"ds:458:358:Dialogue Text","source":"[pic=2]Welcome to Penny Plume’s, Ride and Zoom!","target":"[pic=2]Willkommen bei Penny Feders Flug im Nu!","sourceSha256":"89be31f2937ca6658007938d2a1715fc9b5a4410e9eaf292001042ee9b099330","targetSha256":"c90ddf9c4906ec671b0a6de52a6f037af5162ad2aa80200721543226aa323b6a","conversationId":458,"conversation":"act1/fastTravelDialogueTMP","actor":"8","conversant":"1","title":"","sequence":"","conditions":"","script":"","links":[{"originConversationID":458,"originDialogueID":358,"destinationConversationID":458,"destinationDialogueID":359,"isConnector":0,"priority":2}],"isGroup":0,"unchangedReason":null,"unchangedCategory":null}
{"id":"ds:458:360:Dialogue Text","source":"[pic=1]… And every other day. I’m the only one who works at Penny Plume’s Ride and Zoom.","target":"[pic=1]… Und an jedem anderen Tag. Ich bin die Einzige, die bei Penny Feders Flug im Nu arbeitet.","sourceSha256":"e31e2266c41735d2a1102f896fb88896ad51e64504c23de06bb76a5fa4e50cab","targetSha256":"666ceb4097a9886be3002c289e3e5e088b06d6383ed26236436834e187a9df61","conversationId":458,"conversation":"act1/fastTravelDialogueTMP","actor":"8","conversant":"1","title":"","sequence":"","conditions":"","script":"","links":[{"originConversationID":458,"originDialogueID":360,"destinationConversationID":458,"destinationDialogueID":361,"isConnector":0,"priority":2}],"isGroup":0,"unchangedReason":null,"unchangedCategory":null}
